  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_038) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.7207). This experiment tests whether switching from concat to weighted fusion in this top-performing configuration clarifies the impact of fusion strategies. It isolates the effect of fusion type while keeping other components (encoder, aggregation, profile setting) constant, providing critical insight into whether weighted fusion could further improve performance. This is a logical extension of the current best model and addresses a key design choice with potential to inform future experiments."
